of spinach.

00:29:49.480 --> 00:29:50.799
We eat that way.

00:29:50.799 --> 00:29:52.950
we eat ninety percent

00:29:52.950 --> 00:29:58.250
of our calories come from junk, processed foods, and animal products and ten percent of our

00:29:58.250 --> 00:30:02.020
calories or maybe less come from unprocessed fruits and vegetables.

00:30:02.020 --> 00:30:04.539
We need to make the seesaw look like this.

00:30:04.539 --> 00:30:08.590
So we need to make it look that other cute pizza with 

00:30:08.590 --> 00:30:11.550
the whole big plate of spinach and the Cheetos wedge in there.

00:30:11.550 --> 00:30:13.519
We need to be eating

00:30:13.519 --> 00:30:18.909
unprocessed foods primarily and unprocessed
plants primarily, so fruits, vegetables, 

00:30:18.909 --> 00:30:21.640
legumes - whatever kind you want - whole grains,

00:30:21.640 --> 00:30:22.990
and nuts and seeds.

00:30:22.990 --> 00:30:26.740
Those are the things we need to focus on. To
the extent we can make our seesaw look

00:30:26.740 --> 00:30:29.220
like this instead of like this,

00:30:29.220 --> 00:30:34.200
we're doing really well. And to the extent
for those of you, who think that this is

00:30:34.200 --> 00:30:37.900
insane - which I agree, it's extremely challenging -

00:30:37.900 --> 00:30:40.910
I, I personally believe that if

00:30:40.910 --> 00:30:42.260
most people in this country

00:30:42.260 --> 00:30:43.920
went like this,

00:30:43.920 --> 00:30:46.940
it would be a sea change. It would be a revolution

00:30:46.940 --> 00:30:51.470
to see people getting twenty or thirty percent
of their calories from unprocessed fruits and

00:30:51.470 --> 00:30:52.710
vegetables in this country

00:30:52.710 --> 00:30:55.620
would be an enormous change and

00:30:55.620 --> 00:30:57.980
that's thing, that's the thing anyone can do.

00:30:57.980 --> 00:31:02.020
That's the thing anyone can afford, as the gentleman in the back said before.

00:31:02.020 --> 00:31:05.510
That's the thing, that's the word that needs to spread and that's.

00:31:05.510 --> 00:31:09.410
You know, I think we need to attack this issue both
ways, from the bottom up, which is to change

00:31:09.410 --> 00:31:13.420
our own eating habits and to change the eating
habits of our family and friends and blah, blah,

00:31:13.420 --> 00:31:15.400
blah, and then

00:31:15.400 --> 00:31:20.840
by, by doing our own lobbying, by doing our own advocacy work, by trying to get

00:31:20.840 --> 00:31:23.300
a soda tax passed for example, by trying to get

00:31:23.300 --> 00:31:28.140
good foods into supermarkets, by trying to get supermarkets into all neighborhoods, and by,

00:31:28.140 --> 00:31:30.970
you know, attacking this thing

00:31:30.970 --> 00:31:33.910
from every conceivable angle,

00:31:33.910 --> 00:31:36.280
you know, maybe there's hope for - what? -

00:31:36.280 --> 00:31:41.120
my grandchildren. I don't know. It's too late for me. I can eat any ole way, it wouldn't matter anymore.

